ry 3 scope: standalone SDK sweep returns the shared SweepReceipt shape; CLI execution parity is explicitly deferred to Story 5 by story/test-plan text.\",\"Story hard gate: pre-launch requeue patch and reason-class persistence remain recorded in team-impl-log and are supported by owner requeue/work-queue/FC-0.4 evidence.\",\"Configured story gate and epic gate passed.\"],\"unverified\":[]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"pnpm exec vitest run test/view-sweep.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"pass\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"The remaining materialize not_implemented stub is Story 5 scope and was not treated as a Story 3 production-path issue.\",\"Story 5 still owns the spawned CLI parity execution leg for sweep; Story 3 landed the shared receipt schema validator for that leg.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/03-readiness-sweep/014-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-11T17:24:37.678Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-06-11T17:26:56.660Z\"}\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/007-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"40d4f45a-c0f2-406a-9130-8409d2c605e4\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.5\",\"sessionId\":\"019eb775-234f-7dc3-a34a-4b47567a5264\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019eb775-234f-7dc3-a34a-4b47567a5264\",\"storyId\":\"02-smart-compact\"},\"mode\":\"followup\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"02-smart-compact\",\"title\":\"Story 2: Smart Compact\"},\"artifactsRea